---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="How It Was — A clearer way to document condition" description="A guided way to document condition before something changes hands. Start with our vehicle transport walkthrough.">
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> CONDITION, CAPTURED</span>
      <h1>Before it goes,<br/><span>show how it was.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Your car is about to be collected. Your equipment is going on loan. Take a guided set of photos and notes while it’s still in front of you, so you have a clearer record to come back to.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/vehicle-transport/">Try the vehicle walkthrough <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#how-it-works">How it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
      <p class="microcopy">Free browser preview · No account needed</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <img src="/vehicle-hero.webp" alt="A silver-blue vehicle outdoors, ready for a condition walkaround" width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high" />
      <div class="photo-corner"><span class="corner-icon">⌖</span><span>START WITH A WALKAROUND<br/><strong>Eight guided views</strong></span></div>
      <div class="photo-index">01 / BEFORE COLLECTION</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="benefit-bar"><div class="wrap benefit-inner"><strong>More than a camera roll.</strong><span>One guided place for the details, views and existing marks that matter at handover.</span><a href="/vehicle-transport/">Explore vehicle transport <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>

  <section class="section wrap" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-index">01 / THE PROCESS</span><h2>A quick walkaround.<br/>A clearer starting point.</h2></div><p>Follow a few simple prompts before the item leaves your hands. You don’t have to decide what to photograph from scratch.</p></div>
    <div class="steps-grid">
      <article><span class="step-num">01</span><div class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌗</div><h3>Identify it</h3><p>Add the details that distinguish your vehicle or item.</p></article>
      <article><span class="step-num">02</span><div class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</div><h3>Capture its condition</h3><p>Follow the photo guide and note marks or missing parts already there.</p></article>
      <article><span class="step-num">03</span><div class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</div><h3>Review it together</h3><p>See the photos and notes as one draft before the handover.</p></article>
    </div>
    <p class="preview-note">The current walkthrough saves a draft on this device. Permanent storage, sealed records and later comparison are still in development.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="vehicle-feature"><div class="wrap feature-grid"><div class="feature-image"><img src="/vehicle-hero.webp" alt="Silver-blue vehicle shown from the front-left angle" loading="lazy" width="1672" height="941"/><span>AVAILABLE TO TRY NOW</span></div><div class="feature-copy"><span class="section-index">02 / FIRST WALKTHROUGH</span><h2>Handing over<br/>your car?</h2><p>Document its condition before a transporter collects it. We’ll guide you through eight exterior views, useful close-ups and any existing marks.</p><ul><li>Vehicle and collection details</li><li>Eight guided exterior photos</li><li>Optional close-ups and notes</li></ul><a class="button button-primary" href="/vehicle-transport/">Explore vehicle transport <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>

  <section class="section wrap uses-section" id="uses"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-index">03 / THE BIGGER IDEA</span><h2>For anything that<br/>changes hands.</h2></div><p>Vehicle transport is the starting point. The same idea can help in other moments when the condition of something matters.</p></div><div class="uses-grid"><div class="use-card"><span>PLANNED</span><span class="use-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h3>Valuable items</h3><p>Contents and condition before a courier or repairer takes possession.</p></div><div class="use-card"><span>PLANNED</span><span class="use-icon" aria-hidden="true">↔</span><h3>Equipment handover</h3><p>Marks, accessories and condition when something is lent or hired out.</p></div><div class="use-card"><span>TO EXPLORE</span><span class="use-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><h3>Rental move-in</h3><p>A room-by-room view of a property's condition when keys change hands.</p></div></div></section>

  <section class="closing"><div class="wrap closing-inner"><div><span class="section-index">READY WHEN YOU ARE</span><h2>Take the photos<br/>while it’s still here.</h2><p>Start with a guided vehicle walkaround. It takes place right in your browser.</p></div><a class="button button-white" href="/vehicle-transport/">Try the walkthrough <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Base>
